{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>曾經因為與陳冠希一張激吻照而爆紅的謝熙婷（Cammi，前名謝芷蕙），雖然早就淡出娛樂圈，多年來只出過一首單曲《天真》，但她的富貴生活依然是網民焦點！由昔日出身公屋的小女孩，搖身一變成為生活極度優渥的富貴KOL。雖然有傳警方曾於2022年2月以涉嫌「推廣或便利收受賭注」將其拘捕，但事件似乎無阻她繼續享受奢華人生。前日（4日）她又在社交平台打卡，獨自乘坐私人飛機飛往韓國首爾，盡顯闊太排場！</p><figure><img alt=\"Cammi學生時期出道，被指撞樣已故時裝達人NelNel張學潤。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183875094225620992635417.png/H0F-onnM9mwuSzw_CsyAGKzPnXEa548lt04BZLdOAWQ\"/><figcaption>Cammi學生時期出道，被指撞樣已故時裝達人NelNel張學潤。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi曾與陳冠希拍拖，不少蜜照流出。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183874899446599680607823.png/mspnXMEiUH7DN5IVGTA_S0xObYAv3qNGC8SfkwvEn5M\"/><figcaption>Cammi曾與陳冠希拍拖，不少蜜照流出。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi年前上《東張》教人P圖。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183874894413172736618390.png/-tV8vBGBbcuC7zVIGABkx3tiCgA2arUgiA8iYIgPImA\"/><figcaption>Cammi年前上《東張》教人P圖。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"真人同P圖兩個樣。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183874897059909632379586.png/zFtERtLRKshcEUmTDJT0e5GYyfsNKV1UXgvCMl4LwjI\"/><figcaption>真人同P圖兩個樣。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>樣貌再進化似洋娃娃　曬白滑美腿配巨型LV袋</p><p>Cammi每次出巡的行頭都相當有看頭，懶理網民嘲笑她熱愛P圖致雙腿比例不合理，依然自信滿滿。根據她最新分享的照片可見，今次乘坐私人飛機出遊，她換上了一身純白色的休閒運動打扮，戴着太陽眼鏡及太陽帽，坐在寬敞的機艙座位上大騷白滑修長美腿。最搶眼的莫過於她身前放着一個巨型的LV名牌手袋，極具氣派。</p><p>不少網民亦留意到，Cammi的樣貌似乎又再「進化」，五官越來越精緻立體，猶如真人版洋娃娃一樣！平時喜歡戴滿閃爍飾物的她，今趟旅程反而「返璞歸真」，身上沒有太多花巧的首飾，只在無名指上戴着一隻閃爆巨鑽戒指，對着鏡頭展露甜美笑容，心情大靚。</p><figure><img alt=\"Cammi靚樣不斷進化，身材亦愈嚟愈好。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260706/1150834969678057472168045.png/RJszaVAo75UBjh3viiZdwVox_piAXk2JP9jZPz_Y2T8\"/><figcaption>Cammi靚樣不斷進化，身材亦愈嚟愈好。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi多出出行都係坐私人飛機。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183875414301478912918036.jpeg/l2y0ZsShZ4_HXzM9PgwV5PrVmjpPMk0jc3t-aHN7fmg\"/><figcaption>Cammi多出出行都係坐私人飛機。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"全身名牌，今次飾物只在無名指戴戒指。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183875411021402112382065.jpeg/EXeQcRU-p7KCiQTnN3H99NkZ8zgXw9nzlaIxOpWiMTo\"/><figcaption>全身名牌，今次飾物只在無名指戴戒指。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周圍飛，生活寫意。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183875570891624448409315.png/AJbN83FXocP1avKMOnvXqvZMPWOGMppcbp3zU26d81M\"/><figcaption>周圍飛，生活寫意。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"估唔到今趟飛機餐都好平民化。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183875568647540736610789.png/EkAXjczPJA8KYmrSGnPRGDQ2MAauPBKTv9ySS7_ckks\"/><figcaption>估唔到今趟飛機餐都好平民化。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><p>一人獨享私人飛機　離奇食平民飛機餐</p><p>雖然出入都有私人飛機接送，大家都以為Cammi的飛機餐一定是鮑參翅肚，但她公開的餐單卻出乎意料地貼地！從照片可見，寬闊的餐桌上擺滿了多碟精緻小菜，當中包括一碗蜆肉湯、滷水鵪鶉蛋、冬菇小棠菜、洋蔥炒牛肉，以及幾碟韓式醃製小菜，款式非常豐富但相當平民。整張餐桌上只擺放了一人分量的餐具，似乎今次韓國之旅Cammi並未有與其他人同行，而是單獨一人包下整架私人飛機出遊。由昔日的公屋妹到今日一人獨享私人飛機，難怪網民都驚嘆她背後絕對「投資有道」！</p><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 坐私人飛機，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260706/1150834972429651968216845.png/G7nyNLwy0ghotykfjb90dA5XT4eJgalIUVtY3VFbWN0\"/><figcaption>Cammi 坐私人飛機，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876283109478400162930.jpeg/_rpNSxKh3nqFzGwnSauwZ1ZT0fyX72SzLGI-VCxiPlQ\"/><figcaption>Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876285445836800086394.jpeg/tz0DWxQZWDOvXhvUauYCIBnckBD971PhztDF187Qxdc\"/><figcaption>Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876288507809792912736.jpeg/wnDCuvmiU7ecYO7f6CP9BX63FirIgHVg-C2V0vgtldI\"/><figcaption>Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876434955866112937865.jpeg/5bKCE5NQ90eidJT5XPu4dap5cv9fVx6SU4ccXlOHHF4\"/><figcaption>Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876438193999872419803.jpeg/n6MG-taynqvueyl32vDXs52_raHAjvh8cz6bkXM-m5E\"/><figcaption>Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876441914478592290685.jpeg/sFhI7VtK4wi0sPupTfw-kw-c3VQSXbo1PIkqgzyJKoM\"/><figcaption>Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876444678656000786902.jpeg/fczpuWzxAtZAm8HVhNcsxu1bfovilMpl76h0l--odJc\"/><figcaption>Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876448277499904259346.jpeg/E5AfuH3glqatoC2QWHvnFWqycmcDOWIwlXu6-ZV7uvk\"/><figcaption>Cammi 滿身貴氣，出入坐私人飛機，仲坐遊艇，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 早前飛到現場睇世界盃。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260706/1150834967299756032348712.png/5v-tN1XrI8xDgAF1fuNrIgz1ukR2GbLP9a7AG_WuwBs\"/><figcaption>Cammi 早前飛到現場睇世界盃。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好身材！（IG/@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025048453568270336852369.jpeg/u6HHxPiWAZNw6ATcuArSqrA4bNKAn5xYA80zBAPNMwQ\"/><figcaption>好身材！（IG/@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生活富貴！（IG/@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025048656870379520604257.jpeg/VES1xoPywBQgbO6z-YiSjwxJELJkt5EBqy_Jv6svyb8\"/><figcaption>生活富貴！（IG/@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876149650919424013946.jpeg/PJZ1Ue3oNxDJKvxJREh_MQQBOPNO0yCHqb6nGam-pxk\"/><figcaption>火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876152859693056685301.jpeg/IhoXxUYOFmzJr97Q1hcg5P_hpe7mTFrILbQgiS20IIk\"/><figcaption>火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876156127186944591780.jpeg/_WpBiIzMNcnDiUb0yBV7LFnhXH_8sMR0AC14YwAteGM\"/><figcaption>火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876158803283968591283.jpeg/z-jUtopI0KdAXbWwIxaMSGv4m4RvLf4gh_zOiof8zoo\"/><figcaption>火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876161525518336208715.jpeg/HpvBbdGQpJFkIzd5yl3wPTK9FxHgZju_IIo3liCKN5Y\"/><figcaption>火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876146698129408231709.jpeg/w2Gu4MUhcoTluKK-AW7vFChoBCgoUi_Bni9bu54vW7s\"/><figcaption>火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876149646856192046971.jpeg/usOAqoas-nAXM-S3_ROP4w_DDOg7ibWojbDLSY2wy0k\"/><figcaption>火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876152956293120289503.jpeg/BC3jgm5DL46hf7DcbD1CyOPGfZgom9ahap8J82qfCfM\"/><figcaption>火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876155615612928029546.jpeg/1xC7oJE_TZwVtaPbCM9BrO1ekyxkFPF6jOaJKIzmiSg\"/><figcaption>火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876158123937792392850.jpeg/oJ5KOTD5dqrp33IX3GZsvmHxU9OnQvgLH7Q2eB-0Nng\"/><figcaption>火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876138582151168816750.jpeg/NhYRTFxvdYkCEs84gciH38zXYAwYN4pl25_gOduf4Dk\"/><figcaption>火辣身材。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚到洋娃娃咁。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183876141216305152836249.jpeg/Z9f8QVg3Saik8IUgPMrTUFtUUKJTm6MyM-WwxjPlsMY\"/><figcaption>靚到洋娃娃咁。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T02:08:07.631054+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1643,"images":33,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}